  "source_cause": "Player::Update computes a float displayed beat, then BeatToNoteRowNotRounded and CrossedRows. At all three native clocks the independent timing also returns the exact authored beat. GameplayRuntimeState::run_autoplay instead waits for a cached nanosecond deadline; those deadlines are 1319,1320 and5135 ns later. Waiting advances to the following retained frame, matching the three observed millisecond callback delays.",
